@startuml CodeUnits-Overview
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title CodeUnits of SCBuilder

[SCBuilder]
note as SCBuilderNote
  SCBuilder is the builder image to get used with the ScriptCollection.
end note
SCBuilder .. SCBuilderNote

[SCGitHubRunner]
note as SCGitHubRunnerNote
  SCGitHubRunner is a slim, self-hosted GitHub-Actions-runner image that starts job-containers and keeps their externals host-identical.
end note
SCGitHubRunner .. SCGitHubRunnerNote

[SCTaskRunnerAndroid]
note as SCTaskRunnerAndroidNote
  SCTaskRunnerAndroid is a container-image that provides an HTTP-server which builds Android-app build-steps (e.g. flutter appbundle-builds) on behalf of remote clients (see ScriptCollection's TFCPS_RemoteBuild), using the Android-SDK/NDK/Flutter-toolchain bundled in this image.
end note
SCTaskRunnerAndroid .. SCTaskRunnerAndroidNote

[SCTaskRunnerIOS]
note as SCTaskRunnerIOSNote
  SCTaskRunnerIOS provides an HTTP-server that builds iOS-app build-steps (e.g. flutter ios-builds) natively on a macOS-host on behalf of remote clients (see ScriptCollection's TFCPS_RemoteBuild).
end note
SCTaskRunnerIOS .. SCTaskRunnerIOSNote

[SCTaskRunnerMacOS]
note as SCTaskRunnerMacOSNote
  SCTaskRunnerMacOS provides an HTTP-server that builds operating-system-bound build-steps (e.g. flutter macos-desktop-builds) natively on a macOS-host on behalf of remote clients requiring RunnerOperatingSystem.MacOS (see ScriptCollection's TFCPS_RemoteBuild). iOS-builds delegate to the dedicated SCTaskRunnerIOS-codeunit instead.
end note
SCTaskRunnerMacOS .. SCTaskRunnerMacOSNote

[SCTaskRunnerWindows]
note as SCTaskRunnerWindowsNote
  SCTaskRunnerWindows provides an HTTP-server that builds operating-system-bound build-steps (e.g. flutter windows-builds) natively on a Windows-host on behalf of remote clients (see ScriptCollection's TFCPS_RemoteBuild).
end note
SCTaskRunnerWindows .. SCTaskRunnerWindowsNote


@enduml